# Worktrees live here (EnterWorktree, git worktree add). Each is a full second
# checkout, and .claude is a directory people add wholesale — 1,525 tracked
# files live under .claude/skills — so without this one line a stray `git add
# -A` commits an entire worktree into the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
